Package: pulzr-ble
Provides: parkeze-ble
Replaces: parkeze-ble
Conflicts: parkeze-ble
Depends: kmod-bluetooth, bluez-utils, mosquitto-client-ssl
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@pulzr.net>
License: Apache-2.0
Architecture: all
Description: Bluetooth beacons, heard beside the LoRaWAN radio.
 Scans passively with the board's Bluetooth radio or a USB dongle and sends
 the parking beacons it hears to Pulzar Cloud, which decodes them with the
 device type's codec. Off until turned on from Pulzar Cloud or the console.
